  "reasoning": "The defendant repeatedly stole electric cables from construction sites, valued at over 26,000 RMB, and sold them to a scrap dealer, which constitutes theft (盗窃). Additionally, after his vehicle was lawfully seized by the court, he unlawfully removed it from the court premises, which is the offense of illegal disposal of seized property (非法处置扣押的财产). Both offenses are supported by the detailed evidence presented.",
